[2026-02-02T19:46:17.089+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:17 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.genovatoday.it/eventi/oltre-la-mostra-800-isecolo-delle-mode-andrea-de-pascale5.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
